Subject: [PATCH v6 2/2] net/iavf: disable runtime queue setup during queue
 rate limiting
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 05:42:40 -0400
Message-ID: <20260713094240.1721105-3-dawid.wesierski@intel.com>
